  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive). Pair: ⟦{帰|かえ}す→帰す：02030_kaesu⟧ (transitive; send someone home). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (return to X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {帰|かえ}って⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'has returned (and is there now).'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (go home)\n- ⟦{国|くに}→国：02204_kuni⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{帰|かえ}る (return to one's country)\n- ⟦お{帰|かえ}りなさい→お帰りなさい：01042_okaerinasai⟧ (welcome home - greeting)\n- ⟦{帰|かえ}り→帰り：01275_kaeri⟧ (return trip - noun)\n\nGodan verb despite ending in る. Different from ⟦{戻|もど}る→戻る：01117_modoru⟧ (return to previous state) and ⟦{変|か}える→変える：01089_kaeru⟧ (to change - ichidan).",
